==Major features==
===Zskera Vaults===
[[File:Zskera Vault Az.jpg|thumb|[[:Zskera Vault: Az]]]]

The [[Zskera Vaults]] drives most exploration and treasure finding in the Forbidden Reach. Use a [[Zskera Vault Key]] or 28 from [[Forbidden Hoard]]s, rare elites, and small treasures to open all the vault doors in the active vault. Vaults are randomized per-player and per-week, but are not timed. Many, many mounts, pets, cosmetics, and quest-starting items can be found inside.

===Onyx Annulet and Primordial Stones===
The [[Onyx Annulet]] is a mechanically similar to the [[Pocket-Sized Computation Device]] from [[Mechagon Island]]. It is a ring with 3 sockets that can be fitted with three of 25 Primordial Stones with unique trinket-style effects.

===Primal Infused armor===
Account-bound loot tokens drop somewhat frequently across the reach, which can be turned into item level 385 Primal Infused armor. This serves as both catch-up gear, and part of an eight-piece set.
